h fixed width: set textAutoResize='NONE' after setting resize... order: set characters first, then resize.\n\nOK writing Call A now. I'll keep it < 50k chars, likely ~6k.\n\nAlso should I worry that overriding text inside Text Field/Button instances requires the exact font loaded — nested text font is Inter Semi Bold (button) / Regular (field). My setText helper loads the node's current fontName first.\n\nFor the \"Already have an account? Sign In\" — one text node with setRangeFills and setRangeFontName:\n```js\nconst t=figma.createText();t.fontName=await ld('R');t.characters='Already have an account? Sign In';...;t.setRangeFontName(25,32,{family:'Inter',style:'Semi Bold'});t.setRangeFills(25,32,[{SOLID pri}]);\n```\nCenter: after ranges, t.width auto; set x=(375-t.width)/2. Good.\n\nPrototype reactions: \n```js\nasync function link(srcId or node, destId, trigger='ON_CLICK', opts){node.reactions=[...(node.reactions||[]),{trigger: trigger==='DELAY'?{type:'AFTER_DELAY',timeout:0.8}:{type:'ON_CLICK'},actions:[{type:'NODE',destinationId:destId,navigation:'NAVIGATE',transition:null,preserveScrollPosition:false}]}];}\n```\nTransition null ok.\n\nSplash auto: frame-level reaction with AFTER_DELAY.\n\nFind helpers in wiring call: get frame by name: page.children.find(n=>n.name==='07_Home'); find child by name via findOne.\n\nNames to set during build for linkable nodes: buttons named 'Btn SignUp','Btn Skip','Btn Continue','Btn SendCode','Btn Verify','Btn Ready','Btn BuyStocks','Btn ConfirmOrder','Back', portfolio card 'PortfolioCard', NFLX rows 'RowNFLX', tab bar tabs 'Tab Home' etc. (inside instance children named 'Tab X').\n\nWiring: get instance children: tb.findOne(n=>n.name==='Tab Portfolio') — instances support reactions? Reactions can be set on any node including instance children? Reactions on instance children may be overridden... Setting reactions on nested instance children is allowed (they persist as overrides? actually prototype connections on instance internals are allowed — yes, you can add prototype interactions to elements inside instances).\n\nOK. Also set page.prototypeStartPoint? Not needed.\n\nAlso device for frames: frame.prototypeDevice? optional.\n\nLet me write Call A.","signature":""}],"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9458b504-b751-4b03-9680-f776dd3321b8","uuid":"148516f1-dec2-4999-887f-838072365cc2","timestamp":"2026-10-30T23:28:35.313Z","thinking_duration_ms":265556}
