Username/Email/Password.\n- 03_Filled: Username \"Agatha Bella\", Email \"agbella@email.com\", Password \"••••••••••\" as value text in ink color.\nContinue button y=350. \"Or continue with\" with divider lines y=430. Social buttons y=460 (Google \"Continue with Google\", Apple \"Continue with Apple\") each 44 tall, outline. Bottom \"Already have an account? Sign In\" centered y=700.\n\nTo instance Button/Text Field components: I('4:168') for Button, I('4:174') for field. Their internal text nodes: Button child text id '4:169' name 'Continue'; field text '4:175' name 'Email'. In instance, find by name.\n\n04_Verify_Phone: back arrow at top-left (y=56): circle 40×40 light with \"‹\" or vector chevron. Use vector chevron. Title \"Enter your phone number\" 22 bold y=108. Desc y=144 (2 lines). Phone display: card 327×56 light bg, centered text \"+1 202 555 0147\" 18 semibold, y=196. Number pad y=300 (264 tall → ends 564). Send code button y=600 (instance, label \"Send code\"). \n\n05_Verify_Code: same back. Title \"Enter verification code\", desc \"We have sent a verification code to your mobile number\". 4 code boxes y=210: each 56×56, box1 filled border brand with \"2\", others empty. \"Resend code\" link text centered y=290 (brand). Number pad y=340. Verify account button y=640.\n\n06_Welcome: Welcome_Hand scaled 220 centered y=140. \"Hello Agatha Bella!\" 26 bold y=400. \"Welcome to StockWave\" 16 sub y=440; \"It's great to have you here\" 16 sub y=464? Actually order: greeting bold, then two sub lines. Button \"I'm ready to start!\" y=680.\n\nCharts:\n07 Home content:\n- Header: wordmark instance (127×25) at left, notifications icon right (I 3:155).\n- Portfolio section: label \"Portfolio value\" 12 sub + eye icon; value \"$13,240.11\" 28 bold; trend line 7-day: path across 327 width, ~70 height, green.\n- Indices: 2 Index Card instances side by side (160 each, gap 7 → 160+7+160=327). Card2: Dow Jones/DOW/+1.43%.\n- Wishlist: header \"Wishlist\" + \"add\" (＋ circle